[e54b03ce] 2026-10-23T20:10:39.402Z: When comparing state and county FIPS codes, I found that padding the county FIPS to 5 characters with leading zeros can help resolve join issues - just something to keep in mind for future runs.
[56575e87] 2026-10-02T04:40:31.583Z: When dealing with zip codes, I found that prepending a leading zero to the state FIPS code (e.g. 01 for Alabama) helps with matching.